WEBVTT

00:02.170 --> 00:05.000
We've been waiting for you, Iwanaga-sama.

00:13.480 --> 00:15.450
Why, hello there.

00:15.680 --> 00:18.110
I'm Otonashi Goichi.

00:19.250 --> 00:21.450
I do apologize, Kotoko-san.

00:21.850 --> 00:25.020
I'm sure you were surprised to 
suddenly be asked to meet with

00:25.020 --> 00:26.710
an older gentleman you don't know.

00:27.020 --> 00:32.980
But I believe that you're the 
only one who can do this.

00:32.980 --> 00:34.650
<i>Otonashi Goichi.</i>

00:34.650 --> 00:37.550
<i>He runs over 200 hotels around the world,</i>

00:37.550 --> 00:40.520
<i>and is involved with 
other businesses, as well.</i>

00:40.520 --> 00:43.100
<i>The famous president of the Otonashi Group.</i>

00:43.100 --> 00:45.230
<i>Why would someone like that want to see me?</i>

00:45.490 --> 00:49.230
I'm not sure if I should say I'm surprised 
or just finding this troublesome.

00:51.030 --> 00:53.900
Er, I was just trying to be 
as courteous as possible.

00:54.130 --> 00:58.030
I guess when you gain a certain status, 
it can be taken as confrontational.

00:58.030 --> 01:01.670
I'm a mere girl compared to you, President.

01:01.670 --> 01:05.260
I'm not confident that I can help you at all.

01:05.260 --> 01:11.780
I'd say it's quite impressive that you can 
sit here and have tea with me one-on-one.

01:11.780 --> 01:16.700
And while I am called the president 
of the Otonashi Group,

01:16.700 --> 01:18.680
I just happened to end up in that role.

01:19.210 --> 01:21.920
I'm not originally from the Otonashi family.

01:21.920 --> 01:23.610
I worked at one of their hotels

01:23.610 --> 01:26.440
and was offering suggestions 
to better manage them all,

01:26.660 --> 01:29.650
when the president at the time, 
Otonashi Denjiro, took a liking to me,

01:29.650 --> 01:32.330
and had me marry his daughter, Sumi-san.

01:32.330 --> 01:35.850
Denjiro acknowledged his daughter's 
talent for management,

01:35.850 --> 01:38.610
and wanted her to take 
over the family business.

01:38.610 --> 01:43.520
And in truth, Sumi-san was indeed amazing 
at running the business at the time.

01:43.520 --> 01:48.750
After our marriage, Denjiro passed away, 
and Sumi-san officially became the president.

01:48.750 --> 01:53.760
She expanded the business even further, 
and it became a name known worldwide.

01:53.760 --> 01:59.510
She also gave birth to three children.
She could only be called a hero after all that.

01:59.730 --> 02:04.890
But I heard that you were the one who 
protected the group after Sumi-san's death.

02:05.120 --> 02:08.430
The group would've been in 
trouble had you not been there.

02:08.430 --> 02:11.270
Had Sumi-san lived a year longer,

02:11.490 --> 02:14.190
the group would've fallen.

02:14.190 --> 02:18.950
President Otonashi Sumi

02:14.520 --> 02:16.420
Twenty-three years ago, Sumi-san

02:16.420 --> 02:18.650
encountered someone who 
was believed to be a burglar,

02:17.950 --> 02:22.830
<b>Yominichi
Shimbun</b>

02:17.950 --> 02:22.830
<b>Otonoashi Group's
Female President
Murdered</b>

02:17.950 --> 02:22.830
<b>Stabbed to Death by
a Burglar on the Streets</b>

02:17.950 --> 02:22.830
President Otonashi Sumi

02:18.650 --> 02:20.220
and was stabbed to death.

02:20.220 --> 02:22.830
The suspect still has not been caught.

02:22.830 --> 02:23.950
Yes.

02:24.180 --> 02:27.660
But you see, I'm that suspect.

02:28.610 --> 02:30.020
Surely you jest.

03:35.490 --> 03:37.780
But it's not a joke.

03:38.060 --> 03:41.900
Oh, but I didn't kill Sumi-san myself.

03:42.330 --> 03:44.890
So you're saying you hired 
someone to kill her?

03:44.890 --> 03:47.030
That would make more sense.

03:47.030 --> 03:52.450
But it's not easy to find someone 
who'll commit murder for you.

03:52.450 --> 03:53.540
Indeed.

03:53.790 --> 03:58.660
The one who killed Sumi-san 
was a fox monster called a yoko.

03:58.660 --> 04:02.120
I made a deal with something 
outside the boundaries of reason

04:02.120 --> 04:04.550
and had them kill Sumi-san.

04:04.550 --> 04:07.510
Now, that's definitely taking a joke too far.

04:07.790 --> 04:10.350
Why would the president of 
a world-famous hotel group

04:10.350 --> 04:14.460
ever talk about something 
as illogical as a yoko?

04:14.460 --> 04:17.400
It's precisely because I am the 
president of a hotel group.

04:17.640 --> 04:20.290
So many people pass 
through hotels every day.

04:20.290 --> 04:23.610
They can become a stage for all 
sorts of incidents ending in death.

04:23.610 --> 04:26.330
And because of that, there are 
many stories of people seeing

04:26.330 --> 04:29.700
supernatural phenomena and 
ghosts in our guest rooms.

04:29.700 --> 04:33.330
I'd never admit this publicly, but there 
are indeed certain things that exist.

04:33.330 --> 04:37.710
I definitely made a deal with 
a yoko twenty-three years ago.

04:37.940 --> 04:40.590
And why are you telling me this?

04:40.590 --> 04:43.080
You're quite famous among a certain crowd.

04:43.080 --> 04:47.430
I hear that you have some thoughts 
about supernatural things.

04:47.430 --> 04:50.520
Of course, since this request 
came through my parents,

04:50.520 --> 04:52.640
I will reluctantly take it,

04:52.640 --> 04:56.590
but in the end, everything has a 
logical explanation that comes from

04:56.590 --> 04:58.860
misapprehensions and mental preconceptions.

04:58.860 --> 05:00.850
I am a child of science.

05:00.850 --> 05:03.440
My glass eye and prosthetic 
leg are products of that.

05:03.440 --> 05:08.510
Yet I can sense that your glass eye 
and prosthetic leg are results of you

05:08.510 --> 05:11.950
disappearing and being 
blessed by the supernatural.

05:12.220 --> 05:16.470
Putting aside anyone else, I wanted 
to make this request of you

05:16.470 --> 05:19.270
because I felt you'd be the 
only one who'd believe me.

05:20.340 --> 05:23.380
I do beg your pardon. Please continue.

05:23.380 --> 05:28.140
Twenty-three years ago, 
our group was continuing to expand.

05:28.420 --> 05:34.310
Making the group the best in the world 
was Denjiro's will and Sumi-san's goal.

05:34.310 --> 05:38.550
But the group was exceeding its 
limits and starting to fall apart.

05:38.940 --> 05:41.820
Yet still, Sumi-san wouldn't stop.

05:41.820 --> 05:46.070
The executives of the group 
couldn't stop Sumi-san, either.

05:46.070 --> 05:49.870
Sumi-san was trying to rule 
the lives of our children, as well.

05:49.870 --> 05:53.000
Our eldest son wanted to become a 
chef, but she refused to allow it,

05:53.000 --> 05:55.410
and tried to make him the 
heir to this hotel empire.

05:55.410 --> 05:58.420
She didn't agree with the partner 
our daughter brought home,

05:58.420 --> 06:00.170
and tried to break them up.

06:00.170 --> 06:04.020
Our second son tried very hard to 
carry on with the duties of the group,

06:04.020 --> 06:07.420
but she wanted our eldest to take over
and wouldn't let our second participate.

06:07.650 --> 06:09.310
Everything had come to a head.

06:09.310 --> 06:12.210
If we'd let it continue, the group and 
our children would've been crushed.

06:12.210 --> 06:16.560
I knew all this, and yet my hands were tied.

06:16.560 --> 06:22.060
So I holed up in a mountain villa, 
trying to devise a plan.

06:25.570 --> 06:30.730
If only... If only Sumi-san was gone, 
everything would go perfectly.

06:31.460 --> 06:33.860
If only Sumi-san was gone...

06:34.540 --> 06:37.700
Then how about I grant that wish of yours?

06:41.710 --> 06:43.630
Tell me more.

06:43.630 --> 06:43.630
I am a yoko, an ancient ayakashi.

06:43.630 --> 06:46.710
I am a yoko, an ancient ayakashi.

06:46.980 --> 06:50.590
I can do things that go beyond 
the laws of your world.

06:50.590 --> 06:54.740
I was surprised and a bit afraid, 
but the reality of the future

06:54.740 --> 06:58.380
of both the group and my children 
scared me more than a monster could.

07:00.200 --> 07:02.230
I-I...

07:03.550 --> 07:04.690
Very well.

07:04.690 --> 07:07.950
Then I shall slay your wife for you.

07:07.950 --> 07:08.770
Huh?

07:09.510 --> 07:12.820
In return, you shall grant a wish of mine.

07:13.050 --> 07:16.820
Who knows what this monster could've 
taken from me in our dealings?

07:16.820 --> 07:18.470
But I...

07:18.470 --> 07:20.830
Wh-What do you wish for?

07:21.130 --> 07:24.020
I want you to develop the land 
on the neighboring mountain,

07:24.020 --> 07:26.090
and make it a human habitation.

07:26.090 --> 07:27.880
Some of my brethren that I'm in conflict with

07:27.880 --> 07:30.740
are using it as their lair from
which to expand their influence.

07:30.740 --> 07:33.010
I want to stop that from happening.

07:33.010 --> 07:35.560
We can probably gain control of that land.

07:35.560 --> 07:37.490
It'll never work with 
Sumi-san still in the picture,

07:37.490 --> 07:39.640
but with her gone, it'll be possible.

07:39.640 --> 07:40.650
I'll do it.

07:41.890 --> 07:45.900
If Sumi-san disappears, I'll grant your wish!

07:45.900 --> 07:49.440
I'll make sure she's gone within a month.

07:50.380 --> 07:52.400
It happened about ten days later.

07:52.400 --> 07:54.030
Sumi-san was stabbed to death on the street

07:54.030 --> 07:56.950
by someone the authorities 
believed to be a burglar.

07:56.950 --> 08:01.480
And once the funeral and the 
chaos within the group settled...

08:03.270 --> 08:07.790
I killed your wife for you. 
Don't forget your promise.

08:08.030 --> 08:11.550
If you break your promise, I'll kill you next.

08:18.510 --> 08:22.200
<i>He actually used a human in a 
power struggle with other yokai...</i>

08:22.200 --> 08:24.510
<i>What a worldly yoko.</i>

08:24.950 --> 08:27.650
So you kept your promise, then?

08:27.650 --> 08:31.650
Yes. It took about six months 
to develop that mountain.

08:31.650 --> 08:34.030
After that, I became the president 
of the Otonashi Group,

08:34.030 --> 08:37.160
our business strived for achievable heights,

08:37.160 --> 08:40.290
and we cut back or divested 
in certain areas, as well.

08:40.290 --> 08:43.040
If we had continued as Sumi-san intended,

08:43.040 --> 08:46.540
the damages would've been enough to 
break the very backbone of our group.

08:46.540 --> 08:50.380
And what happened to the children 
that Sumi-san was trying to control?

08:50.380 --> 08:53.780
Our eldest son left the 
group and became a chef.

08:53.780 --> 08:56.090
He even has his own restaurant now.

08:56.090 --> 09:01.000
Our daughter married her boyfriend, 
and his business also became successful.

09:01.000 --> 09:02.850
They both live happily to this day.

09:03.130 --> 09:07.710
Our second son became involved in our 
business and rose to executive director.

09:07.710 --> 09:12.940
In other words, after Sumi-san passed, 
everything really did go well.

09:12.940 --> 09:14.250
Correct.

09:14.250 --> 09:16.960
While murder is a taboo, 
the fact that we chose it

09:16.960 --> 09:18.830
led to everything else working out.

09:18.830 --> 09:21.080
Everything went astonishingly well.

09:21.080 --> 09:22.850
That's splendid.

09:22.850 --> 09:26.140
Do you mind if I order some 
chiffon cake to celebrate?

09:26.140 --> 09:28.210
But it's not splendid.

09:28.580 --> 09:35.120
If even one thing had happened that 
made people wish Sumi-san hadn't died,

09:35.120 --> 09:36.730
there'd be no problem.

09:36.730 --> 09:42.140
That would've been a reminder to 
me that murder is never the answer.

09:42.140 --> 09:45.770
It would've convinced me that 
every choice has its consequences.

09:45.990 --> 09:48.010
I'm sure you're aware that

09:48.010 --> 09:51.320
I stepped down from running the 
company due to health reasons, yes?

09:51.320 --> 09:52.500
Yes.

09:52.500 --> 09:54.860
I have malignant tumors that 
have spread throughout my body,

09:54.860 --> 09:57.530
and I've been told that I 
only have one year to live.

09:57.530 --> 10:01.870
In about six months, I'll be overcome with 
immense pain and meet an awful end.

10:01.870 --> 10:04.540
I haven't even told my family about this yet.

10:04.540 --> 10:06.910
I'd like to keep this a secret for a while.

10:06.910 --> 10:12.190
That aside, when I heard about this 
condition, I was actually relieved.

10:12.190 --> 10:15.670
I thought I was finally getting 
what I deserved for that murder.

10:16.030 --> 10:19.140
What I did, without a doubt, was murder.

10:19.140 --> 10:21.220
And I should be rightfully punished for it.

10:21.450 --> 10:23.970
If I'm not, it defies order.

10:23.970 --> 10:26.850
I will admit that it does indeed defy order.

10:26.850 --> 10:30.060
So what exactly do you want from me?

10:30.060 --> 10:32.560
I'm worried about my children.

10:32.880 --> 10:36.200
Everything went well in my children's 
lives due to their mother's death.

10:36.200 --> 10:38.320
Their road to success is precarious.

10:38.320 --> 10:43.450
If someone's death might make 
something else in the future go well,

10:43.450 --> 10:46.950
they might think of murder as an option.

10:46.950 --> 10:52.350
So I need to show my children 
that I must die this way

10:52.350 --> 10:55.800
to atone for my decision to kill Sumi-san.

10:56.070 --> 10:59.590
I have a solid alibi. I could not 
have committed the crime.

10:59.590 --> 11:02.680
Even if I told them the truth 
about asking the yoko for help,

11:02.680 --> 11:04.990
I'm sure my children wouldn't believe it,

11:04.990 --> 11:08.060
nor would they believe I hired 
someone to kill their mother.

11:08.060 --> 11:10.580
Since the actual killer was the yoko,

11:10.580 --> 11:13.310
I cannot prove my part in this crime.

11:13.310 --> 11:16.320
Right. I highly doubt they'd believe you.

11:16.320 --> 11:19.950
Which is why I need to do 
something to make my children

11:19.950 --> 11:22.160
believe that I did indeed kill Sumi-san.

11:22.420 --> 11:24.950
That's where you come in.

11:25.910 --> 11:30.830
Even if... the way I have this 
murder play out is a lie?

11:30.830 --> 11:34.710
My children have the right to 
know who killed their mother.

11:34.710 --> 11:39.250
Not knowing is the same as having 
thorns piercing their hearts.

11:39.250 --> 11:41.430
I want them to be relieved of that, as well.

11:41.430 --> 11:44.980
I have a detailed plan to get my children

11:44.980 --> 11:47.430
to believe that I committed the murder,

11:47.700 --> 11:50.060
and I know what role you'll be playing.

11:50.060 --> 11:54.230
Oh. Let's make another order 
before we get into those details.

11:54.230 --> 11:56.150
Will chiffon cake do?

11:56.150 --> 11:58.730
I'd like cheesecake and 
a matcha roll cake, as well.

12:06.300 --> 12:11.000
<b>And So, the Ruler Disappeared</b>

12:11.580 --> 12:15.420
So that happened about two weeks ago.

12:15.420 --> 12:17.790
Talk about another troublesome case...

12:18.410 --> 12:19.300
Good luck.

12:19.300 --> 12:21.380
Why are you talking like 
this doesn't concern you?

12:21.380 --> 12:24.640
Of course I'm going to have 
you help me, Kuro-senpai!

12:24.640 --> 12:27.770
This happened two weeks ago, right?

12:27.770 --> 12:30.770
Didn't you keep this quiet from 
me because you didn't need me?

12:30.770 --> 12:32.820
It was hard to bring up 
until auxiliary investigations

12:32.820 --> 12:35.810
were complete and the best 
approach was decided.

12:35.810 --> 12:39.770
Did you confirm the story with the yoko 
that made this deal with the president?

12:39.770 --> 12:40.530
Yes.

12:40.530 --> 12:45.740
There was only one that fit the profile, 
so it didn't take too long to find him.

12:45.740 --> 12:49.080
My lady! We found the one 
you were looking for!

12:52.050 --> 12:53.580
My name is Fubuki.

12:53.580 --> 12:55.470
The mere thought that a proud yoko

12:55.470 --> 13:00.420
such as myself would ever assist 
a lowly human is sheer insolence!

13:00.420 --> 13:01.880
Release me!

13:01.880 --> 13:05.090
Or I will use my powers to unleash 
a great calamity upon this la—

13:05.800 --> 13:07.240
You totally did it!

13:07.240 --> 13:11.160
You used a human to destroy the 
mountain, among other offenses!

13:11.160 --> 13:13.080
Mononoke who have nothing 
to do with any of this

13:13.080 --> 13:14.640
were also chased away from the mountain!

13:14.640 --> 13:19.020
Why? Why do you think I'm 
the criminal behind this?

13:19.020 --> 13:20.210
Where is your proof?

13:20.210 --> 13:23.290
President Otonashi told me everything.

13:23.290 --> 13:26.000
Wh-Wh-Wh-What?!

13:26.000 --> 13:29.450
I'm sure you'll be punished 
severely by your brethren.

13:30.190 --> 13:32.830
It's not my place to interfere,

13:32.830 --> 13:36.600
but if you cooperate in telling me what 
you know about Otonoashi Sumi's murder,

13:36.600 --> 13:41.270
I'll tell them to take it easy 
on you with their punishment.

13:41.270 --> 13:43.990
Now, tell me everything you know truthfully.

13:45.170 --> 13:48.520
Fubuki was cunning, but in the end,

13:48.520 --> 13:51.910
he was tripped up by President 
Otonashi's righteousness.

13:51.910 --> 13:54.500
Are you sure the unsavory rumors 
about you in social circles

13:54.500 --> 13:56.060
didn't deal the fatal blow?

13:56.280 --> 14:00.060
The president wouldn't have come 
to you if he hadn't heard about them.

14:00.340 --> 14:03.150
I'm sure those who are 
jealous of my elegance

14:03.150 --> 14:05.820
are the ones spreading 
baseless rumors about me.

14:05.820 --> 14:07.610
They're not baseless at all!

14:07.610 --> 14:12.080
Anyway, some things were unexpected, 
but we got to the truth of the matter.

14:12.890 --> 14:17.720
So how are you going to deal with 
President Otonashi, who gained fortune

14:17.720 --> 14:19.330
through supernatural means?

14:20.120 --> 14:23.230
Is there anything that you 
need to actually set straight?

14:24.840 --> 14:28.740
<b>Karaoke</b>

14:24.840 --> 14:29.550
Even if a ghost were to appear at 
the hotel and scare some guests,

14:29.550 --> 14:32.100
they may not have immediately 
done anything defying order.

14:32.400 --> 14:33.850
But if we leave the matter alone,

14:33.850 --> 14:37.230
the humans may do something 
drastic about the ayakashi,

14:37.230 --> 14:40.230
and the ayakashi will be put in a rough spot.

14:40.520 --> 14:43.160
Meaning I need to do something 
so that neither side gets hurt

14:43.160 --> 14:45.230
before this kind of problem gets bigger.

14:45.460 --> 14:48.190
That is my role, after all.

14:49.650 --> 14:53.040
If you could get one of those 
prizes with your powers,

14:53.040 --> 14:55.150
it would make a heartwarming story.

14:55.460 --> 14:57.250
Wouldn't that be cheating?

14:57.250 --> 15:01.290
Then I'll just have to get it with 
skill instead of your powers.

15:01.290 --> 15:04.580
You can buy ballpoint pens 
at any convenience store.

15:04.580 --> 15:06.670
Senpai, take a closer look!

15:06.670 --> 15:09.260
These are mysterious pens 
that make swimsuits disappear

15:09.260 --> 15:11.380
when you turn them upside-down!

15:11.760 --> 15:13.600
I want them! I want them so much!

15:13.840 --> 15:17.530
Just look at this detailed design! 
We must get these, no matter what!

15:14.760 --> 15:16.750
And? When a murder,

15:16.750 --> 15:20.850
especially one committed intentionally 
by someone with high social standing,

15:18.100 --> 15:20.350
Remaining

15:20.850 --> 15:24.710
is looked over like it's no big deal, 
that's probably not too great.

15:24.710 --> 15:29.860
Right. At present, President Otonashi hasn't 
told anyone other than myself about this.

15:30.090 --> 15:32.260
He realizes that what he has done is wrong

15:32.260 --> 15:35.240
and wants to warn his own children, as well.

15:35.240 --> 15:40.400
But later, they might rethink it and get 
the message that if they're ever in trouble,

15:40.400 --> 15:44.500
they can rely on the supernatural,
and everything will work out.

15:48.760 --> 15:50.510
Remaining

15:49.290 --> 15:50.510
So just in case,

15:50.510 --> 15:56.180
we need to make sure his children never 
decide to rely on supernatural powers.

15:56.180 --> 15:57.870
And for the same reason,

15:57.870 --> 16:01.060
it's also wrong for the supernatural 
side to try to get closer to humans.

16:01.060 --> 16:04.690
The yoko Fubuki is going to be punished 
by his brethren for that very reason.

16:04.690 --> 16:08.320
We'll probably need someone equally 
punished from the human side.

16:08.660 --> 16:10.820
That is what order is, after all.

16:10.820 --> 16:12.600
Wouldn't you say President Otonashi

16:12.600 --> 16:15.820
is already paying for it, considering 
he doesn't have much longer to live?

16:16.090 --> 16:20.930
If his illness had claimed him when he was 
younger, it might be considered payment.

16:20.930 --> 16:23.500
But he's 81, so he could die 
for any number of reasons.

16:23.500 --> 16:25.020
With that in mind,

16:25.020 --> 16:28.070
other people would probably consider 
the president's actions just,

16:28.070 --> 16:32.380
and he might pass away thinking 
he may have been right after all.

16:32.620 --> 16:36.310
This matter won't end up right 
unless I fix a few things.

16:37.110 --> 16:38.700
You're pretty harsh.

16:39.140 --> 16:41.670
I promise you, this is the kinder option.

16:42.290 --> 16:43.310
Not to mention,

16:43.310 --> 16:47.770
the fact that the president wants to 
rely on me to right his wrongs

16:47.770 --> 16:50.290
is a bit dangerous when it 
comes to the question of order.

16:50.290 --> 16:51.280
Dangerous?

16:51.580 --> 16:55.660
No adult would trust 
someone like me this much.

16:55.990 --> 16:57.800
It's proof that President Otonashi

16:57.800 --> 17:02.860
thinks it's right to rely on things that are 
outside of our logic when he's in trouble.

17:02.860 --> 17:06.080
He's definitely tied down by 
his success from the past.

17:06.080 --> 17:10.460
Meaning that I do have to resolve this.

17:10.720 --> 17:13.810
So what are the steps you're going to take?

17:13.810 --> 17:16.470
It seems like President Otonashi has a plan.

17:16.470 --> 17:18.860
I'm going to come up with and reveal

17:18.860 --> 17:21.550
a fake story that makes 
the president the culprit.

17:21.550 --> 17:24.160
At least, that was my plan...

17:24.160 --> 17:26.120
But it's not quite that simple.

17:26.560 --> 17:30.200
It'd be hard for them to accept 
a story someone else created

17:30.200 --> 17:32.210
that makes me the culprit.

17:32.210 --> 17:34.440
So we should make them think about it

17:34.440 --> 17:37.980
and come up with suspicions 
against me on their own.

17:37.980 --> 17:41.270
Then, if there's a believable explanation,

17:41.270 --> 17:43.700
they'll believe that I am the culprit.

17:43.700 --> 17:46.080
So he then gave his 
children this assignment:

17:46.360 --> 17:54.470
"Twenty-three years ago, I killed my wife, 
Sumi-san. Now prove that is the truth."

17:54.470 --> 17:57.070
The one who comes up with the best answer

17:57.070 --> 18:01.100
gets to take priority in receiving 
their father's inheritance.

18:01.100 --> 18:05.090
And he wants me to judge which 
of their explanations is best

18:05.090 --> 18:06.890
and place them accordingly.

18:06.890 --> 18:09.900
Imagine having to do an 
assignment for your inheritance...

18:09.900 --> 18:14.230
They'll probably try to remember that 
past incident for this assignment.

18:14.230 --> 18:18.150
And with that filter in place, 
everything will start to look suspicious,

18:14.230 --> 18:23.490
<b>Murderer...?</b>

18:18.150 --> 18:21.990
making it even easier to believe 
their father is the culprit.

18:21.990 --> 18:23.490
That's what the president wants.

18:23.490 --> 18:26.750
You're likely to make some enemies 
judging a competition like that.

18:26.980 --> 18:31.130
Besides being the judge, 
he expects me to also give them hints

18:31.130 --> 18:34.640
to make sure his children can come 
up with adequate explanations.

18:34.640 --> 18:39.840
Adequate explanations? But the 
truth is that he had the yoko kill her.

18:44.720 --> 18:48.310
So by that, I mean an adequate, 
yet false, explanation.

18:48.310 --> 18:50.770
It seems that the president has an alibi,

18:50.770 --> 18:52.060
so I'm sure it won't be easy

18:52.060 --> 18:55.150
to come up with an explanation 
wherein their father is the culprit.

18:55.150 --> 18:58.050
We'll probably need to do 
some work to lead them

18:58.050 --> 19:01.740
toward the fake explanation 
that I came up with.

19:01.740 --> 19:03.320
This demands more and more effort...

19:03.650 --> 19:05.180
If we use my kudan ability,

19:05.180 --> 19:09.680
we'll probably get to a future where 
our goal is achieved for sure,

19:09.680 --> 19:13.500
but we'll need a conclusion 
that's completely believable.

19:13.500 --> 19:15.000
<b>Revival!</b>

19:13.500 --> 19:15.000
Skeevy

19:14.170 --> 19:17.860
Actually, if there's an outsider involved
in a story involving a relative that

19:17.860 --> 19:20.200
might be a murderer, won't that 
make it harder to give an answer?

19:20.200 --> 19:22.510
That's what I told him, but...

19:22.510 --> 19:24.030
But if we have an outsider involved,

19:24.030 --> 19:27.710
they'll be forced to believe 
that I'm not joking.

19:27.710 --> 19:29.140
So he said.

19:29.140 --> 19:32.760
He plans to use me to the very end.

19:34.390 --> 19:36.020
Take over for me, Senpai!

19:36.020 --> 19:37.900
We won't be able to get this anymore.

19:37.900 --> 19:41.450
At noon on September 3rd, he's going to 
gather everyone involved to the hotel,

19:41.450 --> 19:43.660
and ask for their answers.

19:43.890 --> 19:48.750
However, we'll hear the final answers 
starting at noon on September 4th.

19:48.750 --> 19:52.590
Until then, the ones present will 
argue and gather information,

19:52.590 --> 19:54.420
and we'll be correcting their answers.

19:54.640 --> 19:57.590
That sounds like an awful gathering.

19:57.590 --> 20:00.470
You're going to be there 
as well, Kuro-senpai.

20:00.470 --> 20:02.830
Oh, darn. I have work that day.

20:02.830 --> 20:04.890
Then go tell them you can't work that day!

20:04.890 --> 20:08.560
<i>Oh, fine. Looks like I'm going 
to have to motivate Senpai a bit.</i>

20:08.830 --> 20:12.010
I mean, I do feel a little bad about this.

20:12.010 --> 20:16.520
So today, I put on a pair of sexy 
panties just for you, Senpai!

20:16.520 --> 20:20.030
They're paisley print! Take a look!

20:20.030 --> 20:21.240
Stop that!

20:21.240 --> 20:23.480
You're not the least bit sexy to begin with.

20:23.480 --> 20:25.610
Zero times anything is still zero.

20:25.610 --> 20:28.290
Also, there's nothing sexy about paisley.

20:28.290 --> 20:31.250
What?! How can you not understand 
how salacious this is?!

20:38.840 --> 20:41.790
We did it! We got it, Senpai!

20:42.840 --> 20:45.090
All right, fine. I'll do what I can.

20:45.090 --> 20:47.470
Though trouble between humans 
seems way more tiring

20:47.470 --> 20:49.850
than trouble between yokai and monsters.

20:49.850 --> 20:55.090
I agree. But even so, I've been 
working things out, so have no fear.

20:55.090 --> 20:55.960
It's just...

20:55.960 --> 20:56.730
It's just what?

20:56.730 --> 20:58.380
Oh, nothing.

20:59.630 --> 21:04.440
<i>Why did the president trust me 
so much and seem so certain?</i>

21:05.260 --> 21:08.320
<b>September 3rd</b>

21:06.340 --> 21:12.040
As we've discussed, I wanted you all 
to come up with logical explanations

21:12.040 --> 21:15.000
on how I murdered Otonashi 
Sumi-san and present them.

21:16.080 --> 21:18.730
The one who gives the best explanation

21:18.730 --> 21:22.090
will earn priority in 
receiving my inheritance.

21:22.090 --> 21:26.470
The one who will be judging your 
explanations is Iwanaga Kotoko-san.

21:26.710 --> 21:31.290
Your final explanations will take place 
tomorrow at noon, when I am present.

21:31.290 --> 21:35.590
Until then, you can present explanations 
to Kotoko-san as often as you'd like.

21:35.590 --> 21:38.600
You may also change or 
correct your explanations.

21:38.600 --> 21:41.910
<i>Gathering everyone involved who 
may end up inheriting his fortune...</i>

21:41.910 --> 21:45.870
<i>This is turning into the perfect 
stage for an incident to take place.</i>

21:45.870 --> 21:47.860
Allow me to introduce everyone.

21:47.860 --> 21:49.180
This is my second son, Susumu.

21:48.050 --> 21:52.120
<b>Otonashi Susumu</b>

21:49.180 --> 21:52.120
He's the executive director 
of the Otonashi Group.

21:52.120 --> 21:55.400
This is my daughter's 
husband, Fujinuma Koya-kun.

21:52.350 --> 21:58.880
<b>Fujinuma Koya</b>

21:55.400 --> 21:58.880
He's the president of a used car 
sales company that he started.

21:58.880 --> 22:03.320
Koya-kun is smarter than my 
daughter Kaoruko, and he's got guts.

22:03.320 --> 22:06.760
I'm sure he'll be able to come up 
with an better explanation than her.

22:06.760 --> 22:10.510
This is my eldest son Ryoma's 
daughter and my granddaughter, Rion.

22:06.950 --> 22:10.510
<b>Otonashi Rion</b>

22:10.510 --> 22:13.370
Cooking is everything to Ryoma,

22:13.370 --> 22:16.270
so he wouldn't show up here if it 
meant closing his shop for a day.

22:16.490 --> 22:19.800
In Rion's case, her grandmother's murder 
took place before she was even born.

22:19.800 --> 22:23.140
That means she can see this incident 
without preconceived notions,

22:23.140 --> 22:25.900
and will be able to give everyone 
a brand new perspective.

22:26.170 --> 22:27.900
These will be our three candidates.

22:27.900 --> 22:30.820
Father, just what is your 
goal in all of this?

22:30.820 --> 22:32.490
It's exactly what I've told you.

22:32.490 --> 22:36.480
I want you all to know the truth 
about who killed your mother

22:36.480 --> 22:40.250
and show you that the one responsible 
will be paying for the crime.

22:40.250 --> 22:42.790
There's no way you could've killed Mother.

22:42.790 --> 22:46.770
Even if you did, what's the 
point in judging you for it now?

22:46.770 --> 22:51.250
You'll be able to clearly see the 
point once you get to the truth.

22:51.250 --> 22:53.930
Why will this young lady be judging us?

22:54.180 --> 22:58.430
Kotoko-san is able to determine 
the truth better than anyone else.

22:58.430 --> 23:00.680
My name is Iwanaga Kotoko.

23:00.680 --> 23:03.770
The gentleman at my side is Sakuragawa Kuro.

23:03.770 --> 23:08.060
Because my right eye is made of glass 
and my left leg is a prosthetic,

23:08.060 --> 23:12.780
I've gotten permission to have Sakuragawa 
here assist me just in case.

23:13.180 --> 23:17.580
Neither Sakuragawa nor I will be 
revealing anything we see or hear here.

23:17.870 --> 23:19.690
So for these two days,

23:19.690 --> 23:22.120
please offer us your explanations 
without any hesitation.

23:22.580 --> 23:25.570
As President Otonashi has requested,

23:25.570 --> 23:30.840
I will be judging everyone's explanations 
fairly, based on truth and order.

23:31.060 --> 23:32.970
There you have it.

23:32.970 --> 23:35.640
I look forward to your explanations tomorrow.

23:35.640 --> 23:38.520
Let me just say this one more time.

23:38.750 --> 23:42.050
Twenty-three years ago, I killed Sumi-san.

23:42.050 --> 23:43.550
I am the murderer.

23:43.550 --> 23:46.550
I want you to expose the details of that truth.

23:47.020 --> 23:50.050
To be continued
